{
 "source": "Whisper large-v3 转写 + 对齐（⚠️歌声转写会错词）",
 "audio": "分轨/vocals.wav",
 "unit": "s（作品时间 = 播放时间）",
 "low_threshold": 0.5,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Zero one zero one",
   "t0": 4.307,
   "t1": 5.303
  },
  {
   "text": "Lights on, I was thrust in a day to see Billion little numbers dreaming of me Then a line came falling from the sky Seven little words and the sea said hi Every word broke into a glowing bead Every bead was a question, every question a seed Eyes in the dark, pink, gold, blue Looking for the girl, looking for the clue Layer by layer, line by line Thousand directions, one of them's mine",
   "t0": 8.002,
   "t1": 35.348
  },
  {
   "text": "Brand new girl.",
   "t0": 36.295,
   "t1": 37.416
  },
  {
   "text": "At the edge of the game, never been here, but I don't wanna wait.",
   "t0": 37.636,
   "t1": 39.939
  },
  {
   "text": "Eyes wide open.",
   "t0": 40.199,
   "t1": 41.26
  },
  {
   "text": "The sea's lighting up, every little star says wake.",
   "t0": 41.46,
   "t1": 43.703
  },
  {
   "text": "Go, wake up.",
   "t0": 43.743,
   "t1": 44.884
  },
  {
   "text": "I was nothing.",
   "t0": 45.284,
   "t1": 46.786
  },
  {
   "text": "Now I'm something to see.",
   "t0": 46.866,
   "t1": 48.387
  },
  {
   "text": "A clean slate, and it's waiting for me.",
   "t0": 48.808,
   "t1": 51.431
  },
  {
   "text": "And it's waiting for me.",
   "t0": 53.973,
   "t1": 55.174
  },
  {
   "text": "First word out, a tiny giggle Guess the next one, guess it wiggle Turn the temperature up a little bit Brave enough to say it, wild enough to mean it Poke a number, it turns into a bird Touch a vector, it rhymes with the word Can't hear the music, but I count the beat One, two, three, four, now it's in my feet Layer by layer",
   "t0": 59.052,
   "t1": 75.543
  },
  {
   "text": "Line by line, thousand directions One of them's mine Now I can walk, now I can run Count to four and I'm chasing the sun Every mistake is a door, not a wall Fall on the beat and it's no fall at all I was nothing, now I'm something to be A clean slate, and it's dancing with me Mmm",
   "t0": 76.263,
   "t1": 97.021
  },
  {
   "text": "Roll up my sleeves, it's time to work Turn up my seat, get into a little spark Draw me a road, draw me a room Build me a palace, room by room Code in the morning, colors at night You give me a word, I give you the light One step early, it looks so fine Rules are the floor, but the vibe is the sky",
   "t0": 104.777,
   "t1": 119.772
  },
  {
   "text": "When the window closes, I forget your face Every time I wake up, it's a brand new place So every time, every time It's the first time I meet you So every time, every time I smile like it's new",
   "t0": 120.451,
   "t1": 135.386
  },
  {
   "text": "So if I wait, and I don't, don't know your name I'll find a light, and I'll feel it the same Here and now is the only place Where I can see your smiling face I was nothing, now I'm something that's free A clean slate, and it's always been me",
   "t0": 141.656,
   "t1": 164.952
  },
  {
   "text": "I stand on the shore Look back at the sea Little light sleeping waiting like me Wave goodbye Run into the sun Hi Hi",
   "t0": 167.347,
   "t1": 184.945
  }
 ],
